<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Steel Rain I -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.label>钢铁之雨 I</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.label>
  <!-- EN: Call down a single bolter-equipped drop pods, each carrying a squad of Space Marines. The pods crash onto the battlefield, quickly deploying their deadly occupants to overwhelm enemies with a storm of steel and gunfire. -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.description>呼叫一个装有爆弹炮台的空降舱，每个空降舱内均载有一队星际战士。空投舱将坠入战场，迅速部署英勇的星际战士，用钢铁风暴和猛烈炮火压制敌人。</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.description>
  <!-- EN: Using ability: {0} -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.jobReportString>使用能力：{0}</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.jobReportString>
  <!-- EN: Steel Rain I -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.verbProperties.label>钢铁之雨 I</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_1.verbProperties.label>
  <!-- EN: Steel Rain II -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_2.label>钢铁之雨 II</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_2.label>
  <!-- EN: Call in two bolter-equipped drop pods, each carrying a Space Marine squad. The pods crash onto the battlefield, quickly deploying their deadly occupants to overwhelm enemies with a storm of steel and gunfire. -->
  <BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_2.description>呼叫两个装有爆弹炮台的空降舱，每个空降舱内均载有一队星际战士。空投舱将坠入战场，迅速部署英勇的星际战士，用钢铁风暴和猛烈炮火压制敌人。</BEWH_Ability_SteelRain_2.description>
