  <BEWH_ChaplainInspire.verbProperties.label>鼓舞</BEWH_ChaplainInspire.verbProperties.label>
  <!-- EN: Steel Rain III -->
  <BEWH_ChapterMasterSteelRain.label>钢铁之雨 III</BEWH_ChapterMasterSteelRain.label>
  <!-- EN: Call down a barrage of bolter-equipped drop pods, each carrying a squad of Space Marines. The pods crash onto the battlefield, quickly deploying their deadly occupants to overwhelm enemies with a storm of steel and gunfire. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterMasterSteelRain.description>召唤一连串装有爆弹炮台的空降舱，每个空降舱内均载有一队星际战士。空投舱将坠入战场，迅速部署英勇的星际战士，用钢铁风暴和猛烈炮火压制敌人。</BEWH_ChapterMasterSteelRain.description>
